This repository documents an experimental deployment built on
timothystewart6/vllm-gb10 (https://github.com/timothystewart6/vllm-gb10), which
was used as the GB10 vLLM image/repository base. It also relies on vLLM and
DFlash2 upstream work. This repository adds deployment configuration,
benchmarking, and documentation; it does not claim ownership of upstream code
or checkpoints.

The optional `harness/` integration is based on the MIT-licensed code in
slee-persis/GVS5H at commit 0bc99eae8c6ef0d49a91808272c60928113da1ce.
This repository contains only an integration wrapper and a minimal patch; it
does not redistribute GVS5H source, its paper, figures, run data, or benchmark
problem statements. See harness/README.md for setup and attribution.
